r final gift is you are not going  to have to watch me place  chess because trust me that would be  painful for all involved  for those of you who have made a gift  tonight we thank you for your generosity  and for your support of chess  it means so much to us now if you're  still considering an auction item as a  holiday gift and there's so many great  things please look at them  the auction will remain open until  tuesday december 8th  at 5 p.m central time so please please  please go check that out  and finally we want to thank our  founders and presenting sponsors  dr jeannie karen singfeld rex singfeld  edward jones and ascension  they made this evening possible they've  made so much happen for this community  and we're  truly truly grateful to them so thank  you  we hope you had a great night we're so  grateful to everybody behind the scenes  who made this happen in these  challenging times  and please stay safe have a happy  holiday  you
 

